  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Retail Observatory",
    "overview": "A calm workspace for examining real retail transactions. The supplied dashboard references establish a light neutral grey canvas, rounded panels, dark selected navigation and a powder blue secondary KPI. DM Sans carries both the conversational page headings and the compact analytical detail.\n\nThe interface operates as a college retail analytics demonstration across Overview, Sales, Customers, Products, Markets and Data lab. Charts, totals and tables provide the hierarchy; decorative imagery has no role. Data definitions and limitations sit close to the evidence they explain.",
